---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';

const jurisdiction = site.address.city
  ? `the courts at ${site.address.city}, India`
  : 'the competent courts in India having jurisdiction over our registered office';

const toc = [
  { id: 'acceptance', label: 'Acceptance' },
  { id: 'about-us', label: 'About us' },
  { id: 'using-this-website', label: 'Using this website' },
  { id: 'our-products', label: 'Our products' },
  { id: 'intellectual-property', label: 'Intellectual property' },
  { id: 'third-party-links', label: 'Third-party links' },
  { id: 'disclaimer', label: 'Disclaimer' },
  { id: 'limitation-of-liability', label: 'Limitation of liability' },
  { id: 'governing-law', label: 'Governing law' },
  { id: 'changes', label: 'Changes' },
  { id: 'contact', label: 'Contact' },
];
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="The terms that govern your use of the Rachna Softech LLP website."
  summary="The ground rules for using this website. Each of our products also has its own terms, shown when you sign up."
  toc={toc}
>
  <h2 id="acceptance">1. Acceptance of these terms</h2>
  <p>
    By accessing or using this website, you agree to these Terms of Use and to our <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>. If you do not
    agree, please do not use the website.
  </p>

  <h2 id="about-us">2. About us</h2>
  <p>
    This website is owned and operated by {site.legalName}, a limited liability partnership registered in India{site.llpin && ` (LLPIN: ${site.llpin})`}.
    In these terms, “we”, “us” and “our” refer to {site.legalName}.
  </p>

  <h2 id="using-this-website">3. Using this website</h2>
  <p>You may use this website only for lawful purposes. You agree not to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>use the website in any way that breaches applicable laws or regulations;</li>
    <li>attempt to gain unauthorised access to the website, its servers or any connected systems;</li>
    <li>introduce viruses, malware or any other harmful code, or interfere with the website’s normal operation;</li>
    <li>scrape, copy or harvest content or data from the website using automated means without our written permission; or</li>
    <li>impersonate any person or misrepresent your affiliation with anyone, including when using our contact form.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="our-products">4. Our products</h2>
  <p>
    Our products are offered under product-specific terms, plans or subscription agreements that are presented when you sign up. If those terms
    conflict with these Terms of Use, the product terms prevail for that product.
  </p>
  <p>
    Information on this website about products, features, pricing and availability is for general information only and may change as our products
    evolve. Products marked beta, in development or coming soon may change significantly, and may not be released. Any custom or partnership work
    is governed by a separate written agreement.
  </p>

  <h2 id="intellectual-property">5. Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>
    The content of this website, including text, graphics, logos, illustrations and code, is owned by or licensed to {site.legalName} and is
    protected by applicable intellectual property laws. Product names and logos are our trademarks. You may view and share links to the website
    for personal or internal business purposes, but you may not copy, reproduce or reuse its content for commercial purposes without our prior
    written consent. Photographs are used under their respective licences.
  </p>

  <h2 id="third-party-links">6. Third-party links</h2>
  <p>
    The website may link to third-party websites or services. We do not control them and are not responsible for their content, policies or
    practices. Accessing them is at your own risk.
  </p>

  <h2 id="disclaimer">7. Disclaimer</h2>
  <p>
    We work to keep the website accurate and available, but it is provided on an “as is” and “as available” basis. To the extent permitted by
    law, we make no warranties, express or implied, about the completeness, accuracy or availability of the website or its content.
  </p>

  <h2 id="limitation-of-liability">8. Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the maximum extent permitted by law, {site.legalName} and its partners shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special or
    consequential loss or damage arising from your use of, or inability to use, this website. Nothing in these terms limits any liability that
    cannot be limited under applicable law.
  </p>

  <h2 id="governing-law">9. Governing law and jurisdiction</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by the laws of India. Any dispute arising from them is subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of {jurisdiction}.</p>

  <h2 id="changes">10. Changes to these terms</h2>
  <p>
    We may update these terms from time to time. The “Last updated” date above shows the latest version. Continuing to use the website after an
    update means you accept the revised terms.
  </p>

  <h2 id="contact">11. Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about these terms? Email us at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
</LegalLayout>
